<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.</p>

<p>I'm sorry to hear that we were unable to give you the seat you requested on your flight from&nbsp; {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.</p>

<p>Although we strive to meet every customers seating preference, sometimes we need to rearrange the seating for operational, safety or security reasons, even after boarding.<br />
<br />
We always do our best to re-book you to a seat similar to the one you held, but we can't always guarantee that it will be in the same configuration.<br />
<br />
<strong>We've requested your refund</strong><br />
The <em><strong>&lt;insert name of fee&gt; </strong></em>will be refunded back to the original form of payment in approximately 7 business days.<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
